WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.349 --> 00:00:17.570
Mandy woke up, the house was very quiet.

2
00:00:18.591 --> 00:00:21.992
Vinnie was already awake and eating breakfast.

3
00:00:23.093 --> 00:00:26.234
Mom was in the kitchen reading the newspaper.

4
00:00:27.614 --> 00:00:29.255
Mandy grabbed a banana.

5
00:00:29.275 --> 00:00:31.296
"Where's Dad?"

6
00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:32.300
she asked.

7
00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:36.003
"He had a business meeting," said Mom.

8
00:00:36.023 --> 00:00:39.324
"He went to the city early this morning."

9
00:00:40.725 --> 00:00:43.167
Mandy barely heard what Mom was saying.

10
00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:46.569
All she could think about was the attic.

11
00:00:47.609 --> 00:00:50.291
If Dad was out, then it was empty!

12
00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:53.192
Mandy looked over at Vinnie.

13
00:00:54.193 --> 00:00:56.314
He was looking back at her, grinning.

14
00:00:56.334 --> 00:00:58.175
"Let's go!"

15
00:00:58.595 --> 00:00:59.336
he whispered.

16
00:01:00.792 --> 00:01:04.114
A minute later the two kids ran up the stairs.

17
00:01:05.275 --> 00:01:08.416
Vinnie pulled the photo album from its hiding spot.

18
00:01:09.437 --> 00:01:14.540
They flipped toward the end and noticed there were just two pages left.

19
00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:18.182
But neither one said anything about it.

20
00:01:18.202 --> 00:01:20.663
"There he is!"

21
00:01:21.243 --> 00:01:24.025
Mandy spotted the old man in the photo.

22
00:01:25.045 --> 00:01:29.548
He stood in front of a building with three large, glowing gates.

23
00:01:31.492 --> 00:01:33.933
Vinnie and Mandy stared at the photo.

24
00:01:35.014 --> 00:01:38.515
Seconds later they tumbled into the dark tunnel.

25
00:01:41.556 --> 00:01:44.197
Mandy and Vinnie landed on their backs.

26
00:01:45.298 --> 00:01:47.839
They lay on the floor of a small room.

27
00:01:48.979 --> 00:01:51.800
Mandy sat up and then looked at Vinnie.

28
00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:54.981
"Does this floor feel warm?"

29
00:01:55.362 --> 00:01:55.942
she asked.

30
00:01:55.962 --> 00:01:59.043
"Yes," said Vinnie.

31
00:01:59.963 --> 00:02:01.024
He sat up too.

32
00:02:02.212 --> 00:02:05.453
"I hope there isn't a fire," said Mandy.

33
00:02:06.353 --> 00:02:09.334
She leaped to her feet and looked around.

34
00:02:10.614 --> 00:02:15.035
Suddenly the door opened, and a boy entered the room.

35
00:02:16.056 --> 00:02:18.977
He jumped back when he saw Mandy and Vinnie.

36
00:02:18.997 --> 00:02:20.817
"Who are you?"

37
00:02:21.297 --> 00:02:22.417
the boy demanded.

38
00:02:23.418 --> 00:02:24.738
"What are you doing here?"

39
00:02:24.758 --> 00:02:30.200
"Uh, well, I, uh…" stuttered Vinnie.

40
00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:36.972
"Uh I'm Mandy, and this is my brother, Vinnie," said Mandy.

41
00:02:36.992 --> 00:02:39.974
"The floor is very warm!"

42
00:02:40.455 --> 00:02:41.055
she added.

43
00:02:41.075 --> 00:02:44.958
"Is is your house on fire?"

44
00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:50.223
The boy stared at Mandy for a moment, confused.

45
00:02:51.344 --> 00:02:53.305
Then he burst out laughing.

46
00:02:53.325 --> 00:02:56.127
"My home is not on fire!

47
00:02:56.508 --> 00:02:58.149
Our floors are heated!"

48
00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:01.652
He shook his head, still laughing.

49
00:03:02.732 --> 00:03:05.053
"Don't you have heated floors in your house?"

50
00:03:06.513 --> 00:03:08.794
Mandy blushed and shook her head.

51
00:03:09.794 --> 00:03:12.115
She felt silly for saying something.

52
00:03:12.135 --> 00:03:17.036
"Follow me, and I will show you how it works," the boy continued.

53
00:03:17.056 --> 00:03:19.937
"My name is Gildong, by the way."

54
00:03:21.277 --> 00:03:22.918
He led them to the kitchen.

55
00:03:22.938 --> 00:03:28.339
"Heat from the stove warms stones under the floor," he explained.

56
00:03:28.359 --> 00:03:31.140
"That is how the floor stays hot."

57
00:03:32.104 --> 00:03:34.406
"Wow," said Vinnie.

58
00:03:34.426 --> 00:03:36.628
"That's cool!"

59
00:03:37.088 --> 00:03:37.869
Mandy added.

60
00:03:37.889 --> 00:03:42.112
"I mean warm," she joked.

61
00:03:42.132 --> 00:03:45.235
"Come," Gildong said.

62
00:03:46.235 --> 00:03:48.217
They followed him to the porch.

63
00:03:49.258 --> 00:03:53.842
He reached for a bamboo basket and began wrapping it in cloth.

64
00:03:53.862 --> 00:03:57.745
"I have an important errand," he explained.

65
00:03:57.765 --> 00:04:01.648
"I must bring these bowls to a nobleman's house.

66
00:04:02.685 --> 00:04:05.431
His family is having a special ceremony tonight.

67
00:04:06.394 --> 00:04:07.697
Would you like to come with me?"

68
00:04:07.717 --> 00:04:11.847
"Yes!" cried Vinnie and Mandy together.
